sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  actor O as Other user
  participant App as Android app
  participant Gems
  participant GDB as Gems DB
  participant Feed as Live Feed

  U->>App: Open the dashboard
  App->>Gems: GET /gem/newest[?limit]
  Gems->>GDB: Latest gems, newest first
  GDB-->>Gems: Gems
  Gems-->>App: 200 [gems]
  App->>Feed: WebSocket /feed { type: "subscribe", latitude, longitude, radius }
  alt Location or radius invalid
    Feed-->>App: { type: "error", message } (connection stays open)
  else Valid
    Feed-->>App: { type: "subscribed", latitude, longitude, radius }
  end
  App-->>U: Show the latest gems
  O->>Gems: POST /gem (adds a gem within the user's radius)
  Gems->>GDB: Insert gem
  Gems->>Feed: publishGemAdded(gem)
  Feed-->>App: { type: "gem.added", gem } (only to apps whose area contains it)
  App-->>U: Add the new gem to the top of the list, no refresh
  Note over Feed: Connections that stop answering the heartbeat are dropped,<br/>so publishing only reaches live apps
